Subject: [ 122/171 ] USB: ftdi_sio: fix use-after-free in TIOCMIWAIT
References: <20130411202503.783159048@goodmis.org>
Content-Disposition: inline; filename=0122-USB-ftdi_sio-fix-use-after-free-in-TIOCMIWAIT.patch
Sender: linux-kernel-owner@vger.kernel.org
